  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַצָּרַעַת זָרְחָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְעֻזִּיָּה בְּמִצְחוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַמַּלְכוּת נִטְּלָה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מֵעֻזִּיָּה בְּזַעֲפוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>יַעַן וּבְיַעַן:</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַל גַּסּוּת הָרוּחַ<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בָּאִים נְגָעִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַל אִישׁ זָחוּחַ<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רוּחַ וּנְשִׂיאִים.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִי שֶׁמְּצַמְצֵם אֶת עַצְמוֹ מְעַט - מְגַלֶּה שֶׁמְּקוֹמוֹ מִתְרַחֵב</span></div><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"לִפְנֵי שֶׁבֶר - גָּאוֹן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלִפְנֵי כִשָּׁלוֹן - גֹּבַהּ רוּחַ\" (משלי ט\"ז יח)</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"וְהִזָּה עַל הַמִּטַּהֵר מִן הַצָּרַעַת <b>שֶׁבַע פְּעָמִים</b>\" (ויקרא י\"ד ז)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"אָמַר רַבִּי שְׁמוּאֵל בַּר נַחְמָנִי אָמַר רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן: עַל <b>שִׁבְעָה</b> דְּבָרִים נְגָעִים בָּאִין - עַל לָשׁוֹן הָרָע, וְעַל שְׁפִיכוּת דָּמִים, וְעַל שְׁבוּעַת שָׁוְא, וְעַל גִּילּוּי עֲרָיוֹת, וְעַל גַּסּוּת הָרוּחַ, וְעַל הַגָּזֵל, וְעַל צָרוּת הָעַיִן\" (ערכין ט\"ז עמוד א)</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">\"כנגד&nbsp;</span><b style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">ז'</b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;דברים שנגעים באים עליהם מזה עליו&nbsp;</span><b style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">שבעה</b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;פעמים\" (בעל הטורים)</span></p></div><div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></span></h2><p style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<b>נִרְפָּא</b>' / '<b>אִתַּסִּי</b>'<br /><span><span><span>❖ רפואה, בריאות - אסותא</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<b>מַיִם חַיִּים</b>' / '<b>מֵי מַבּוּעַ</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;מי מעיין נובע</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<b>וְהִזָּה</b>' / '<b>וְיַדֵּי</b>'<br /><span><span><span>❖ להזות, להשליך - לְיַדּוֹת</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<b>וְהֶעֱמִיד</b>' / '<b>וִיקִים</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;להעמיד, להציב - להקים</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">'<b>וּמִיֶּתֶר</b>' / '<b>וּמִשְּׁאָר</b>'<br /><span><span><span>❖ יתרה - שארית</span></span></span></span></li></ol><p></p></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span></h2></span></div></div><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimPH2wFrYRF16tPt03AKGO7u0E9BwmJK7IBGrAeCSlr53V8ay8uksIsPJcAjRJw1BdcU8fG_q2t8Y8zQXxW1fMgeZHCQC0rG8o9qYyxABRxSyvwyP1O6YrxY1ghytTgrtR2Nj105fROoA9mNm_DdPFRlmSDoAVnx2ce5tyqeHtEpaia3Tqawr9x-4dkGY/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Dec%2028,%202025,%2007_36_53%20PM.png\" style=\"clear: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"איור רישומי בשחור־לבן של דמות אנושית פשוטה, שראשה גבוה ומוגזם מעל הגוף, ובמרכז המצח כתם בהיר המדמה נגע צרעת\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimPH2wFrYRF16tPt03AKGO7u0E9BwmJK7IBGrAeCSlr53V8ay8uksIsPJcAjRJw1BdcU8fG_q2t8Y8zQXxW1fMgeZHCQC0rG8o9qYyxABRxSyvwyP1O6YrxY1ghytTgrtR2Nj105fROoA9mNm_DdPFRlmSDoAVnx2ce5tyqeHtEpaia3Tqawr9x-4dkGY/w133-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Dec%2028,%202025,%2007_36_53%20PM.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נגעי גסות הרוח</span></td></t